{"unit_id":"tag:0AHF:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设\n<MATH_0002>\n为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的交换图（commutative diagram）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>是满射的（surjective）、平坦的（flat）且局部有限呈示的（locally of finite presentation），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>都是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示的"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底对象，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"图中对象，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"图中箭头，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"给定图，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"态射性质，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"态射性质，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示的","context":"态射性质，词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"引理中的态射性质，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06EM:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的性质，且该性质关于目标是<MATH_0005>局部的。设<MATH_0006>具有性质<MATH_0007>。对于任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，若它平坦（flat），相应地<SPACE_0001>平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation），相应地<SPACE_0002>平坦局部完全交（syntomic），相应地<SPACE_0003>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale），则基变换（base change）<MATH_0009>（对<MATH_0010>所作）具有性质<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"性质的主体，未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基变换箭头，未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"相应箭头性质，未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示","context":"相应箭头性质，未批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"相应箭头性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"相应箭头性质，未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"所得箭头，未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
